   "reason": "First reading: at its latest record (16 Jul 2026 on Epoch's Capabilities Index) the open-weights frontier trailed the closed frontier by 4.4 months, between the fast band (3 months or less) and the normal band (9 months or more), so the status is emerging until the lag settles on one side.",
